# Solterra Logistics Portal - AI Assistant Context & Rules

## 🏢 BUSINESS OVERVIEW

### What This System Does
Solterra Solutions operates a **solar logistics management platform** that handles:
- **Solar panel/module tracking** throughout supply chain
- **Multi-tenant customer account management** (DESRI, DDPM, etc.)
- **Warehouse & delivery coordination** across multiple locations
- **Document management** for compliance & operations
- **Financial tracking** (invoices, accounts payable, freight costs)
- **Project lifecycle management** from planning to delivery

### Key Business Entities
- **Customer Accounts**: DESRI, DDPM Test, Test Account (multi-tenant)
- **Projects**: Solar installations (Babacomari, DDPm, Morgan Test, etc.)
- **Modules**: Individual solar panels with serial numbers & wattages  
- **Warehouses**: Storage & distribution centers (including ports)
- **Deliveries**: Shipments between locations (domestic & overseas)
- **Documents**: Compliance, invoices, PODs, test data, etc.

## 🗄️ DATABASE SCHEMA

### Core Tables (38 total)
```sql
-- USERS & ACCOUNTS
users (id, username, email, password, role)
customer_accounts (id, name) 
customer_account_users (user_id, account_id, role)
account_users (account_id, user_id, role) -- Legacy table

-- PROJECTS & LOGISTICS  
projects (id, account_id, project_name, warehouse_id, street_address, city, state, zip_code)
deliveries (id, project_id, supplier, origin_type, warehouse_id, container_number, is_overseas_shipment)
inventory_pallets (id, current_warehouse_id, current_project_id, assigned_project_id)
modules (id, project_id, serial_number, wattage, pallet_id)

-- DOCUMENTS & FILES
project_documents (id, project_id, document_type, file_path, uploaded_by, is_active)
-- document_types: invoices, pods, flash_test_data, bills_of_lading, warehousing, 
--                 modules, delivery_packet, incident_reports, safe_harbor_evidence

-- WAREHOUSES & LOCATIONS
warehouses (id, name, address, is_port, country)
manufacturers (id, name, country)
manufacturer_locations (id, manufacturer_id, location_name, address)

-- FINANCIAL
accounts_payable (id, vendor_name, project_id, amount, receipt_file)
project_invoices (id, project_id, invoice_number, amount)
freight_estimates (id, user_id, origin, destination, estimated_cost)
warehouse_estimates (id, project_id, estimated_cost)

-- SPECIALIZED
flash_test_data (id, project_id, test_data)
warranty_claims (id, module_id, claim_status, replacement_serial)
site_safety (id, project_id, safety_requirements)
sunny_memory (id, user_id, title, content) -- AI assistant memory
```

### Key Relationships & Foreign Keys
```sql
-- Core hierarchy: customer_accounts → projects → modules/deliveries/documents
customer_accounts.id → projects.account_id (CASCADE)
projects.id → project_documents.project_id (CASCADE)
projects.id → modules.project_id (CASCADE)
projects.id → deliveries.project_id (CASCADE)

-- User permissions
users.id → customer_account_users.user_id (CASCADE)
customer_accounts.id → customer_account_users.account_id (CASCADE)

-- Logistics chain
warehouses.id → projects.warehouse_id (SET NULL)
warehouses.id → deliveries.warehouse_id (SET NULL)
warehouses.id → inventory_pallets.current_warehouse_id (SET NULL)

-- Document tracking
users.id → project_documents.uploaded_by (CASCADE)
```

